{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106141","id":2503957507,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6VP1wD","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106141","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106141.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106141.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106141","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106141/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106141/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106141/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/49c79660429896af293a4ce35cf72437031cd560","number":106141,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix unexpected control position change when left/top offsets not match `pos_cache` (reverted)","user":{"login":"L2750558108","id":119792950,"node_id":"U_kgDOByPlNg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119792950?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/L2750558108","html_url":"https://github.com/L2750558108","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L2750558108/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L2750558108/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L2750558108/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L2750558108/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L2750558108/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L2750558108/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L2750558108/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L2750558108/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L2750558108/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nIn https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104357, in order to prevent the size of the offsets from being broken during offsets recalculate in set_position, the rect which use size calculated in real time via the offsets (previously use size_cache) is used in the offsets' recalculating\r\n\r\nBut this doesn't take into account the position of the rect. If the current pos_cache does not match (edge[0], edge[1]) calculated via offsets (e.g. the control's size is propped up by the minimum size when the grow_direction is not Right/Bottom), the position of the control may be offset to the top left of the expected position. This pr solve this\r\n\r\nFixes : https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105771","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godot